  =>  Sigma_P^TF = c(y) [D_iPhi D_jPhi]^TF,   c(y) = mu(y) = 1 - exp(-y)
  [PASS] c(y) derived nonzero
  [PASS] c(y) is y-DEPENDENT (not constant)   dc/dy = exp(-y)
