PART 2  --  ORDER COUNTING in eps  (the potential-amplitude expansion)
==============================================================================
  Sigma_P   (obstruction, [D Phi D Phi]^TF) :  eps^2   field-content Phi^2
  Sigma_AA  (from (1/2)f^2 A.KK^-1.A)        :  eps^4   field-content Phi^4
