  [PASS] Sigma_P is eps^2
  [PASS] Sigma_AA is eps^4
  [PASS] Sigma_AR (the DESIGNED canceller) is eps^3
  [PASS] Sigma_RR is eps^2

  KILL #1 (order counting).  The cross-term Sigma_AR -- the term the class was
  DESIGNED to cancel Sigma_P with -- lives at eps^3, one order ABOVE the
  obstruction Sigma_P at eps^2.  Each eps-order must vanish separately, so a
  eps^3 term CANNOT cancel an eps^2 term.  The advertised mechanism is void.
  [PASS] Sigma_P and the DESIGNED canceller Sigma_AR live at DIFFERENT eps-orders   (eps^2 vs eps^3) => cannot cancel

  The ONLY carrier stress at the obstruction's order eps^2 is Sigma_RR, but
  its field-content is Psi^2 (pure curvature), NOT Phi^2.  Proceed to the
  field-content / spin-channel test to see if it can nonetheless cancel Sigma_P.

